          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"formulam5 people3\" group=\"People\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Status\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stars\" name=\"showStars\" checked>\n\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ca9236\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-9': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n          <b>Testimonials</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet nulla vel, consectetur massa adipiscing.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">“I finally lost the stubborn belly fat that wouldn’t go away. Hormovance gave me more energy throughout the day and helped me stay active without feeling tired.\"</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/t-43.webp\" alt=\"John D.\" title>\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Michael K., New Jersey&nbsp;USA</b></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">“Within a few weeks, I noticed betterappetite control and a real boost in motivation for workouts. Hormovance made managing my cravings so much easier.”</span><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/6814e5d3742c2-sarahlgirl.webp\" alt=\"Mark H\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>&nbsp;Tania L., Texas</b>&nbsp;<b>USA</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;“I love that Hormovance is all-natural and doesn’t cause energy crashes like other fat burners. My metabolism feels more active, and I’m losing weight steadily!”</span><br></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/glucotrust-bites-review3.webp\" alt=\"Charlie Williams\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Sarah M., California</b>&nbsp;<b>USA</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row mt-0 mt-md-5\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
